<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Vegetables</strong>: If you&rsquo;re after a low-carb dinner, serve your balsamic marinated chicken with a side of my <a href="https://foolproofliving.com/garlic-butter-green-beans/">Garlic and Butter Green Beans</a> or <a href="https://foolproofliving.com/sauteed-asparagus/">Sauteed Asparagus</a>.</p>



